TITLE Equilibration of 100C solution with mineral assemblage and fixed gas partial pressures

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50 mmol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0 10
    Gypsum     0 10
    Aragonite  0 10
    CO2(g)     1.0 10
    CH4(g)     5.0 10
    H2S(g)     10.0 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_output3.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -temperature true
    -si Calcite Gypsum Aragonite

END
